From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:42:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 40/54] Trace the donor's GPU hang recovery behind
 -wex-reset-trace

Record enter/exit of the single-pass channel recovery, the engine reset,
scheduler reset and resume, and the CSB12 command-streamer reset with
GDRST, RCS ring, reset-control, execlist and forcewake registers. Hooks
only the donor functions no other WhateverXe route owns; the channel and
command-streamer steps are recorded from their existing wrappers. The ring
is serialized on read and each event is also logged, so the trace
survives a forced restart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
